*> A batch program with the files a job step must provide.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAYUPD.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT MASTER ASSIGN TO PAYMAST
        ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
        RECORD KEY IS MASTER-ID
        ALTERNATE RECORD KEY IS MASTER-NAME
        FILE STATUS IS MASTER-STATUS.
    SELECT OPTIONAL RATES ASSIGN TO UT-S-RATES.
    SELECT REPORT-OUT ASSIGN TO PAYRPT.
    SELECT WORK-FILE ASSIGN TO SORTWK01.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD  MASTER.
01  MASTER-REC.
    05  MASTER-ID      PIC X(8).
    05  MASTER-NAME    PIC X(30).
FD  RATES.
01  RATE-REC           PIC X(80).
FD  REPORT-OUT.
01  REPORT-REC         PIC X(132).
SD  WORK-FILE.
01  WORK-REC           PIC X(80).
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  MASTER-STATUS      PIC XX.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    OPEN I-O MASTER
    IF MASTER-STATUS NOT = "00"
        DISPLAY "CANNOT OPEN MASTER"
    END-IF
    OPEN INPUT RATES OUTPUT REPORT-OUT
    CALL "PAYLOG"
    CLOSE MASTER RATES REPORT-OUT
    GOBACK.
